# Never publish anything from a real installation. Diagnostics downloads,
# config-entry dumps, state snapshots and backtest caches all carry entity ids,
# names and context ids from someone's home.
*.diagnostics.json
config_entry-layers-*.json
snapshots/
*backtest_cache*.json

